{
  "title": "Signed stride-duration drift adds no demonstrated predictive benefit across two public gait collections",
  "abstract": "Signed stride-duration drift did not demonstrate added Parkinson/control prediction across two public gait collections: external logloss 0.403740 baseline versus 0.406727 augmented, delta +0.002987, joint-bootstrap95% interval [-0.034275, 0.061300]. This exploratory result neither establishes equivalence nor validates a biomarker.",
